t with exploration, gathering, crafting, and building. Dungeons, group raids, and a weekly raid boss offer PvE challenges; the Flix Saga adds a story-driven mode. Flix Clash is a standalone card mode; PvP is also available.\n\nProgression runs through levels, attributes (HP, AP, MP), gear, companions, and in-game currencies. Friends, parties, and guilds support multiplayer; accounts are linked to the Flix platform (profile, stats, Hall of Fame).", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/flixfam-abenteuer", "game_localizations": [{"id": 59715, "region": {"id": 4, "name": "Europe", "category": "continent", "identifier": "EU"}}]}